  "details": "The new way the main menu displays world is more organised yes but it also has introduced less visibility in some cases.\nAs with the old system they were displayed in rows and you could see multiple rows at the same time. meaning more visibility and if you had a good thumbnail it would attract the users attention. \nThe new system you have to click buttons and you will open see that category. \nIt would be nice for a sorting feature to be adding with the or next to the button which expands and shrinks this menu which displays the worlds in rows next to the buttons so as it is in a similar fashion with the older menu but better as its now updated.",
